{"3070190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Biolune", "steam_appid": 3070190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create favorable conditions for ecosystems to flourish.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build contraptions to attract comets, which will release water, resources, and occasionally even frozen flora and fauna.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants require various amounts of light, water, soil, and air to grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals need to eat, drink, and breathe. They also need to find shelter from the elements and each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waste from plants and animals will break down into fertile soil, letting ecosystems grow larger and more complex over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organisms evolve over generations.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every organism has genes and can mutate randomly in many ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push a species in a specific direction, or leave it alone and watch it evolve in response to the environment. Feeling impatient? Get in the lab and edit some genomes – just don’t be surprised if things go off the rails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create adorable critters, bizarre monsters, and anything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and fix other robots as you travel from moon to moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most will be helpful, but not all are friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about your shared origins, and try to understand your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the moons change, so do you.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomass gathered from a healthy ecosystem can be converted into useful resources, or into energy to travel between moons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to build yourself new tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your fragile, beautiful world... or don't, and watch chaos unfold.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create favorable conditions for ecosystems to flourish.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build contraptions to attract comets, which will release water, resources, and occasionally even frozen flora and fauna.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants require various amounts of light, water, soil, and air to grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals need to eat, drink, and breathe. They also need to find shelter from the elements and each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waste from plants and animals will break down into fertile soil, letting ecosystems grow larger and more complex over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organisms evolve over generations.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every organism has genes and can mutate randomly in many ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push a species in a specific direction, or leave it alone and watch it evolve in response to the environment. Feeling impatient? Get in the lab and edit some genomes – just don’t be surprised if things go off the rails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create adorable critters, bizarre monsters, and anything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and fix other robots as you travel from moon to moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most will be helpful, but not all are friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about your shared origins, and try to understand your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the moons change, so do you.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomass gathered from a healthy ecosystem can be converted into useful resources, or into energy to travel between moons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to build yourself new tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your fragile, beautiful world... or don't, and watch chaos unfold.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An artificial life simulation about a robot cultivating ecosystems on the moons of a ruined planet. Grow fantastical plants and animals, facilitate their evolution, and gather resources while discovering the secrets of this strange world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070190/a7a94f20971d33ea0970f86c3168a0b0fef0dc39/header.jpg?t=1761965254", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070190/1569d0ef3992646b0a8e51881909606d2b07f88b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761965254", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070190/1569d0ef3992646b0a8e51881909606d2b07f88b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761965254", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>